      },
      "message": "Sandbox environment variables in launch_xml/launch_yaml tests (#1001)\n\nLaunchContext.environment is os.environ itself, so a test that executes\nReplaceEnvironmentVariables leaves the process environment cleared for every\ntest that runs after it. pytest 9 collects test/<pkg>/ before test/, which put\ntest_rep_env.py ahead of test_xmllint.py and broke it on the Windows nightly\nstarting with build 3910. Add an autouse fixture that restores os.environ after\neach test so the suite no longer depends on collection order.\n\nSigned-off-by: Michael Carroll <mjcarroll.oss@gmail.com>",
